Package: mintmotion
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: cinnamon (>= 6.0), mpv, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, python3-xlib, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, ffmpeg
Recommends: mesa-va-drivers, pkexec
Conflicts: fondo-video
Replaces: fondo-video
Maintainer: José Antonio Ramos Miralles (Sombra) <hola@joseantonioramos.es>
Homepage: https://github.com/MintMotion/mintmotion
Description: MintMotion - video wallpaper for the Cinnamon desktop
 Plays a video as the desktop background in Linux Mint and LMDE (Cinnamon,
 X11 session), below the desktop icons and all windows, with hardware
 decoding. It pauses by itself when the desktop is fully covered and keeps
 playing while any part of it is visible; if it stays covered for two
 minutes, the player is closed and all its memory is freed.
 .
 Includes the "MintMotion" application to choose the video and the options.
 Available in English, Spanish, French and Simplified Chinese.
